    "title": "The 84th Preston County Buckwheat Festival's Senior Escorts",
    "text": "KINGWOOD, W.Va. — Each week draws closer to the 84th Preston County Buckwheat Festival, and the stage is set with Senior Escorts along with Senior and Junior Princesses for the upcoming pageant celebration.\nWhile the public enjoys the festival’s festivities for one week each September, the planning process is a year-round endeavor. As soon as one festival concludes, the groundwork for the next begins, and during the winter months, a primary focus is the careful selection of the next royal courts.",
